Wow! The recent upgrade of Erbing's rise is really exciting, but I have to say—jumping in now to chase the high is like grabbing skewers with bare hands on a barbecue grill, be careful not to get burned! (Just kidding, but serious face.jpg)
👉 Let's check out some hardcore stuff:
• The range of 3220-3250 is just like a popular hotpot restaurant on the weekend, packed with orders from the 'foodie army', dense liquidity means it can easily trigger sharp fluctuations here;
• Although the upgrade is beneficial + funds are supporting, the 1-hour RSI has already been lying high gasping for breath, short-term profit-taking could crash the party at any time;
• My own tracking system shows that if it doesn't break 2950 on a pullback, the next scenario could be heading straight for the 3500 stage! But if it can't even hold 3100... (those who understand will understand).
